{"id":"wb-5-46","name":"尉迟寺遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"尉迟寺遗址","text":"尉迟寺遗址，位于安徽省亳州市，全国重点文物保护单位之一。\n尉迟寺遗址是一座史前人类文化遗址。1989年起，中国社会科学院考古研究所安徽工作队开始进行发掘工作，期间发现大量墓葬与灰坑、祭祀坑等。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%89%E8%BF%9F%E5%AF%BA%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":86783677,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86783677","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2ea4aa032fdc3e828c7a023a.jpg","title":"七足镂孔器1248.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%83%E8%B6%B3%E9%95%82%E5%AD%94%E5%99%A81248.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/92/%E4%B8%83%E8%B6%B3%E9%95%82%E5%AD%94%E5%99%A81248.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Cangminzho","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Vessel with Seven Feet and Openwork 蒙城尉迟寺遗址出土","width":320,"height":480,"matchEvidence":"维基共享资源名称与所在地一致"}}